course: dictionary
lesson: 6915
title: A short word with many jobs
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words are short pieces of longer words, and they can mean very different things. Pac is one of them. You will not find it as a word on its own in an everyday sentence. You will meet it in names and short forms.
explain: Look at the words next to it. In «Pac-Man (1980)», the hyphen and the word Man tell you that Pac is part of a name, the name of a famous yellow video game character. In news about elections, PAC stands for political action committee, a group that collects money to help elect politicians.
explain: The clues change the meaning. Pac-12 is a group of US university sports teams, so it is a name too. Written with a small p, pac can be a short form of package or pack, as on some shop labels. Ask yourself: what is the rest of the word or sentence about? That tells you which meaning you need.
fact: Pac is a fragment, a small part of a longer word or name.
fact: PAC means political action committee: a group that collects money to help elect politicians or support causes.
fact: «Pac-Man» is a famous video game from 1980 about a yellow circle that eats dots in a maze.
fact: The Pac-12 is a group of US university sports teams.
fact: In a horned frog, the nickname «Pac-Man frog» comes from its mouth, which is nearly as wide as its body.
exercise: In «Pac-Man (1980), each ghost had its own simple targeting rules», what is Pac-Man? | *A yellow circle that eats dots in a maze game | A famous video game | A group of sports teams | A type of petrol station
exercise: In US news, what does PAC mean? | A short word for package | A pack of cards for a party game | *A group that collects money to help elect politicians | A video game about ghosts
exercise: Which words in the sentence «The Pac-12 is a group of US university sports teams» show that Pac is part of a name? | Pac and of | The and is | *Pac-12 and group of US university sports teams | sports and a
test: «Super PACs» raise and spend money in elections. What does PAC mean here? | Pack of cards | Package | Pac-Man | *Political action committee, a group that raises money for elections
test: On a shop label you see «pac» written in small letters. What is it most likely short for? | Petrol station | *Package | Pac-Man | Politician
exam: «The horned frog is nicknamed the Pac-Man frog.» Which of these is the best reason Pac is used? | Pac means very old | It means a group that collects money | Pac is a sports team | *It is part of a nickname that shows the frog's wide mouth
